
  GT-BE98 mainline development OS (OpenRC, RAM rootfs - changes are lost
  at reboot; a reboot or an unhealthy box returns to the committed slot).

  gt-be98-status                     summary (health, modules, links)
  rc-service gt-be98-drivers restart reload the Runner driver
  rc-service gt-be98-wifi start      Wi-Fi driver + hostapd (optional)
  sysctl -w kernel.panic_on_oops=0   survive an oops while debugging
  DO NOT stop gt-be98-watchdog unless you want a reset in ~30 s.

